From 4b017df2a6aaaa6a501170821bc95e557ed8c8e3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 16:50:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Light blue theme

The Glide magenta was a baseline, not a brand requirement. Brand becomes a
light blue ramp; neutrals cool to match; the old magenta survives as the
'berry' accent so the CASA identity is not lost.

Hydration moves from sky blue to teal so no module accent collides with the
new brand. Accent tints now come from our own tokens rather than Tailwind's
default emerald/amber/sky, so a module's color is one decision.

brand-600 sits at 5.4:1 on white -- it works as button fill under white text
and as text on a white card.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Eh4J16AztgMeXLucu7vNMF
